{"Turn on \"Connect to 2 devices simultaneously\" above to manage devices.", "請先開啟上方的「同時連線至2個裝置」，才能管理裝置。"},
{"Devices that have been paired with these headphones. Click one for more actions.", "與這副耳機配對過的裝置，點一下可以執行更多操作。"},
{"Noise cancelling blocks out the world around you; ambient sound lets it in through the microphones, for commutes or a quick chat.", "降噪會阻隔周圍的聲音；環境聲音則透過麥克風讓你聽見周圍，適合通勤或和人簡短交談。"},
{"The higher the level, the more of your surroundings you hear.", "數值越高，聽到的周圍聲音越多。"},
{"Adjusts the ambient sound level automatically to the noise around you.", "依周圍噪音自動調整環境聲音的強度。"},
{"Lets voices through while keeping other surrounding noise down.", "讓人聲清楚穿透，同時壓低其他環境噪音。"},
{"When you start talking, playback pauses and ambient sound turns on; it resumes after you stop.", "偵測到你開口說話時，會暫停播放並切換到環境聲音；停止說話一段時間後自動恢復。"},
{"How long to wait after you stop talking before playback resumes.", "停止說話後，要等多久才恢復播放。"},
{"Pick a preset sound, or choose Custom and drag the bands below.", "選擇預設音色，或選「自訂」後拖動下方各頻段。"},
{"Strengthens the bass while keeping it clear.", "加強低音，同時保持聲音清晰不混濁。"},
{"Restores the high-frequency detail lost in compressed music, bringing streams closer to high-resolution sound. Uses a little more battery.", "將壓縮音樂中流失的高頻細節補回，讓串流音樂更接近高解析音質。會稍微增加耗電。"},
{"Background music makes it sound like a speaker across the room, easy to work to. Cinema makes films more immersive.", "背景音樂模式讓聲音像從房間另一頭的喇叭播放，適合工作時聆聽；電影模式讓影片更有臨場感。"},
{"Sound quality uses LDAC and other high-quality codecs when available. If the sound keeps cutting out, choose stable connection.", "聲音品質優先會在可用時使用 LDAC 等高音質編碼；聲音經常斷斷續續時，請改選穩定連線優先。"},
{"Turning this off disables the touch controls on the outside of the headphones, to avoid accidental touches.", "關閉後，耳機外側的觸控操作會停用，避免誤觸。"},
{"The modes the NC/AMB button cycles through when you press it.", "按下 NC/AMB 按鈕時依序切換的模式。"},
{"What the touch sensor or button on each side does.", "設定左右耳機觸控感應器或按鍵的功能。"},
{"Pauses playback when you take the headphones off and resumes when you put them back on.", "取下耳機時自動暫停播放，重新戴上後繼續播放。"},
{"Nod to answer a call or shake your head to decline it.", "來電時點頭接聽、搖頭拒接。"},
{"The audio device turns itself off to save power.", "音訊裝置將會自動關閉，以便降低耗電量。"},
{"If the headphones are not worn for a while, they turn themselves off.", "如果一定時間未佩戴，則耳機自動關閉電源。"},
{"Voice prompts from the headphones for power on, low battery, mode changes and more.", "由耳機播放開機、電量不足、切換模式等提示語音。"},
